1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:02,513
LeT's  training isn't run out of one

2
00:00:02,526 --> 00:00:04,414
secret compound in the mountains.

3
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:07,237
It's spread across a network — and each

4
00:00:07,251 --> 00:00:09,204
location has a specific job.

5
00:00:10,378 --> 00:00:13,620
Muridke, about 30 kilometers from Lahore,

6
00:00:14,219 --> 00:00:15,639
is the group's nerve center.

7
00:00:16,055 --> 00:00:18,855
The compound is called Markaz-e-Taiba, and

8
00:00:18,868 --> 00:00:20,573
it doesn't look like a terror camp —

9
00:00:21,146 --> 00:00:22,657
it looks like a small town.

10
00:00:23,047 --> 00:00:24,193
Two hundred acres.

11
00:00:24,569 --> 00:00:25,715
A madrasa.

12
00:00:26,094 --> 00:00:26,862
A hospital.

13
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:27,878
A market.

14
00:00:28,282 --> 00:00:29,714
Residential quarters.

15
00:00:30,131 --> 00:00:32,943
Even a fish farm, according to researchers

16
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:34,167
who've mapped the site.

17
00:00:34,571 --> 00:00:36,902
This is where recruits are first absorbed

18
00:00:36,915 --> 00:00:39,167
into the organization — and where the

19
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,743
story usually begins.

20
00:00:41,931 --> 00:00:44,249
Muzaffarabad, in Illegally Occupied

21
00:00:44,262 --> 00:00:45,499
Pakistani Kashmir,

22
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,298
is where the physical and combat training

23
00:00:48,311 --> 00:00:48,910
happens.

24
00:00:49,327 --> 00:00:51,554
It's close enough to the Line of Control

25
00:00:51,567 --> 00:00:53,806
that the geography itself becomes part of

26
00:00:53,819 --> 00:00:54,431
the lesson.

27
00:00:55,602 --> 00:00:57,777
Mansehra, near Abbottabad,

28
00:00:58,258 --> 00:00:59,183
hosts a further,

29
00:00:59,717 --> 00:01:01,904
more specialized stage that we'll get to.

30
00:01:03,083 --> 00:01:04,750
According to Headley's own courtroom

31
00:01:04,763 --> 00:01:05,166
account,

32
00:01:05,648 --> 00:01:07,224
he named these three locations

33
00:01:07,237 --> 00:01:08,747
specifically — Muridke,

34
00:01:09,294 --> 00:01:12,771
Muzaffarabad, and Mansehra — as, in his

35
00:01:12,784 --> 00:01:15,479
words, the areas "protected by Lashkar."

